  "answer": "The cheapest base model of the MacBook Pro 14-inch with an M5 chip (M5 family) is the MacBook Pro 14-inch with the M5 Pro chip (15-core CPU/16-core GPU, Space Black, standard display) at a base price of $2,499.00. Available upgrade options and their maximum selections (no Pre-Installed Software offered): Display finish Nano-texture +$150.00; Chip upgrade to M5 Pro 18-core CPU/20-core GPU +$200.00; Unified memory 64GB +$1,000.00; Storage 4TB +$1,500.00; Power adapter 96W included with the upgraded chip; Keyboard language no-cost. Maximum upgrade configuration total: $5,349.00. Total price difference from the base model: $5,349.00 - $2,499.00 = $2,850.00.",
